{"id":"bebf6927dec8d972","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/117_PΣ₁.md","title":"117 PΣ₁","display":"117_PΣ₁","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})=\n\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:m\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;m\\}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})=\n\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:m\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;m\\}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\to\\mathsf{Var},\n\\qquad \\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\to\\mathsf{Var},\n\\qquad \\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>非逻辑符号满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(0)=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(S)=1\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(S)=1\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(+)=\\operatorname{ar}(\\times)=\\operatorname{ar}(&lt;)=2\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(+)=\\operatorname{ar}(\\times)=\\operatorname{ar}(&lt;)=2\\)</span>；原始构造子为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{succ},\\operatorname{add},\\operatorname{mul},\n\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{lt},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}\">\\(\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{succ},\\operatorname{add},\\operatorname{mul},\n\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{lt},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\Sigma_1\">\\(P\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 在本文件中形式化为无参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 归纳理论：归纳公式可为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>，但除归纳变量外不允许自由参数。这是它区别于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Sigma_1\">\\(I\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 的目标差异。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、公式与无参数-$\\Sigma_1$\">2. 项、公式与无参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\Rightarrow x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\Rightarrow x\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(0\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow S(t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow S(t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow s\\times t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow s\\times t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow s\\doteq t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow s\\doteq t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow s&lt;t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow s&lt;t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow \\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow \\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow \\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\Rightarrow \\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>派生记号不是新构造子，定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\n\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\n\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有界量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;t\">\\(\\forall x&lt;t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x&lt;t\">\\(\\exists x&lt;t\\)</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，并定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;t\\,A:=\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\exists x&lt;t\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x&lt;t\\,A:=\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\exists x&lt;t\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 的最小子集，满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(s\\doteq t\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&lt;t\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(s&lt;t\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A,B\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;tA\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(\\forall x&lt;tA\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x&lt;tA\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(\\exists x&lt;tA\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\\subseteq C\">\\(\\Delta_0\\subseteq C\\)</span>。\n2a. 若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in C\">\\(A,B\\in C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B\\in C\">\\(A\\land B\\in C\\)</span>。\n2b. 若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in C\">\\(A,B\\in C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B\\in C\">\\(A\\lor B\\in C\\)</span>。\n3a. 若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in C\">\\(A\\in C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg A\\in C\">\\(\\neg\\neg A\\in C\\)</span>。\n3b. 若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in C\">\\(A\\in C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;tA\\in C\">\\(\\forall x&lt;tA\\in C\\)</span>。\n3c. 若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in C\">\\(A\\in C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x&lt;tA\\in C\">\\(\\exists x&lt;tA\\in C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in C\">\\(A\\in C\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists xA\\in C\">\\(\\exists xA\\in C\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义无参数归纳公式类</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NoPar}_{\\Sigma_1}(x,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\land A\\in\\Sigma_1\\land\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NoPar}_{\\Sigma_1}(x,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\land A\\in\\Sigma_1\\land\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PF}\\Sigma_1=\n\\{(x,A):\\operatorname{NoPar}_{\\Sigma_1}(x,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PF}\\Sigma_1=\n\\{(x,A):\\operatorname{NoPar}_{\\Sigma_1}(x,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{PF}\\Sigma_1\">\\((x,A)\\in\\mathsf{PF}\\Sigma_1\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的自由变量至多为归纳变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>；归纳实例\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=0]\">\\(A[x:=0]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=S(x)]\">\\(A[x:=S(x)]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\">\\(\\forall xA\\)</span> 不含额外参数。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{P\\Sigma_1}:\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^{P\\Sigma_1}:\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^{P\\Sigma_1}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F^{P\\Sigma_1}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]\">\\(t[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{P\\Sigma_1}(t,x,s)\">\\(Sub_T^{P\\Sigma_1}(t,x,s)\\)</span>，记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]\">\\(A[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^{P\\Sigma_1}(A,x,s)\">\\(Sub_F^{P\\Sigma_1}(A,x,s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s+t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s\\times t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s+t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s\\times t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)=\\varnothing,\n\\quad \\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)=\\varnothing,\n\\quad \\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换与公式替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}s,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=s]=0,\\quad S(t)[x:=s]=S(t[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}s,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=s]=0,\\quad S(t)[x:=s]=S(t[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u+v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]+v[x:=s],\\quad\n(u\\times v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]\\times v[x:=s],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u+v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]+v[x:=s],\\quad\n(u\\times v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]\\times v[x:=s],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\doteq v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\doteq v[x:=s]),\\quad\n(u&lt;v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]&lt;v[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\doteq v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\doteq v[x:=s]),\\quad\n(u&lt;v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]&lt;v[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\\quad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=(A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\\quad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=(A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\forall yA\">\\(C=\\forall yA\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=z])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=z])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{P\\Sigma_1}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{P\\Sigma_1}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是等价关系；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\Rightarrow((A_0\\to A_1),(B_0\\to B_1))\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\Rightarrow((A_0\\to A_1),(B_0\\to B_1))\\in E\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall xA,\\forall y(A[x:=y]))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall xA,\\forall y(A[x:=y]))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由改名与绑定改名定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}(A,x,y):=A[x:=y],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}(\\forall xA,y):=\\forall y(A[x:=y]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}(A,x,y):=A[x:=y],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}(\\forall xA,y):=\\forall y(A[x:=y]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundRen}\\)</span> 的定义域条件为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-逻辑公理\">4. 逻辑公理</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\\)</span> 为下列七族的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-基本算术公理与无参数-$\\Sigma_1$-归纳\">5. 基本算术公理与无参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 归纳</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\n\\{\\neg S(x)\\doteq0,\\ S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y,\\\nx+0\\doteq x,\\ x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y),\\\nx\\times0\\doteq0,\\ x\\times S(y)\\doteq(x\\times y)+x,\\\n\\neg x&lt;0,\\ x&lt;S(y)\\leftrightarrow(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y):x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\n\\{\\neg S(x)\\doteq0,\\ S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y,\\\nx+0\\doteq x,\\ x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y),\\\nx\\times0\\doteq0,\\ x\\times S(y)\\doteq(x\\times y)+x,\\\n\\neg x&lt;0,\\ x&lt;S(y)\\leftrightarrow(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y):x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 归纳公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{P\\Sigma_1}=\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xA):\n(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{PF}\\Sigma_1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{P\\Sigma_1}=\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xA):\n(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{PF}\\Sigma_1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf P\\Sigma_1}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{P\\Sigma_1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf P\\Sigma_1}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{P\\Sigma_1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha^{P\\Sigma_1}B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha^{P\\Sigma_1}B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1},A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1},A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{P\\Sigma_1}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{P\\Sigma_1}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 是非空有限公式序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf P\\Sigma_1}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf P\\Sigma_1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(C)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(C)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{P\\Sigma_1}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{P\\Sigma_1}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{P\\Sigma_1}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{P\\Sigma_1}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{P\\Sigma_1}=\n(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1},\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F},\nSub_T^{P\\Sigma_1},Sub_F^{P\\Sigma_1},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{P\\Sigma_1},\\Delta_0,\\Sigma_1,\n\\operatorname{NoPar}_{\\Sigma_1},\\mathsf{PF}\\Sigma_1,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf P\\Sigma_1},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{P\\Sigma_1},\\vdash_{P\\Sigma_1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{P\\Sigma_1}=\n(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\mathsf{Term}_{P\\Sigma_1},\\mathsf{Frm}_{P\\Sigma_1},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T},\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F},\nSub_T^{P\\Sigma_1},Sub_